        "r": 558.5337000000001,
        "b": 705.4983344167462
      },
      "content": "There are four, conduction free, PTFE studs fitting in the cavity to support the cook plate, each held in place by M10 flange nuts and graphite stud gasket torqued to 0.6Nm. The nuts are locked with a screw."
